======================================================================
(A) Fact1(completion) <=> Fact2(no-return) <=> no-3-cycle, n=5
======================================================================
  4000/4000 random tournaments: Fact1 == Fact2 == (no 3-cycle). The two facts are
  the SAME transitivity; Fact2 = 'the arc X->Y forbids the return cycle Z->X->Y->Z'.

======================================================================
