======================================================================
READING: c_1 = 1-2/n exactly (first clearance, unconditional). Generic speeds:
c_k stay ~ 1-2/n, product ~ (1-2/n)^{n-1} -> clearances PROPAGATE (Fact 1), few
return 3-cycles (Fact 2 holds) -> LOCAL EMPTINESS. AP/regular: many 3-term
resonances (RETURN cycles, Fact 2 fails maximally) -> conditional clearances
collapse, product -> 0 (tight). The hidden no-return fact = no resonance = the
inside debt vanishes = the cascade product stays positive. LRC = no return wins.
======================================================================
